WEBVTT

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:32.482
We want to swoop in, do our job
and leave feeling satisfied

00:05:32.506 --> 00:05:35.085
that we've made a difference
in somebody's life.

00:05:35.498 --> 00:05:37.315
But that just doesn't happen

00:05:37.339 --> 00:05:40.734
when we're dealing with somebody
with substance use disorder.

00:05:42.239 --> 00:05:45.154
We leave feeling frustrated and useless.

00:05:45.612 --> 00:05:48.301
We deal with the same people
over and over again,

00:05:48.325 --> 00:05:50.287
with no positive outcome.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:52.602
And you know what?

00:05:52.626 --> 00:05:57.395
At some point, I realized
that it is up to us as first responders

00:05:57.419 --> 00:05:58.847
and as a community

00:05:58.871 --> 00:06:00.495
to solve this problem,